{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "165", "x": 0.8951488575183035, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03859439108533224, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Part 1", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15360198182160828, "w": 0.06881167324518032, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "House Owner: Good morning.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.18386064948090083, "w": 0.3129660592165679, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Shelley Meyer: Hi, this is Shelley Meyer. I'm renting your house on Archwood", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.21411924169740834, "w": 0.8267312133018335, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Avenue. I'm due to move in next week.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23443998217136106, "w": 0.3959808218871912, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "House Owner: Oh, yes. Hello, Miss Meyer. What can I do for you?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.26469857438786853, "w": 0.6643574715008823, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Shelley Meyer: When I viewed the house, I told you I'll most probably need to rent", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.29499428445460674, "w": 0.8262753873572174, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "some furniture. At least until I know whether my temporary work contract is going", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.31546334544391214, "w": 0.8267383900486, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to be made permanent.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.33578406705716857, "w": 0.24500316443269918, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "House Owner: Yes, of course. I remember. And I said I could give you some", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3660427347164611, "w": 0.8258389386288703, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "information about furniture rental companies in the city.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3863633997476288, "w": 0.5780341260460237, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Shelley Meyer: That's right.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4166220674069213, "w": 0.2945899222276458, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "House Owner: Well, the biggest company is called Peak Rentals. I've", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4468806596234288, "w": 0.8265876783665068, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "recommended them to other people and I've always heard positive reports about", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.46737446584622133, "w": 0.8260992494865806, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "them.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.48769520632017405, "w": 0.0677707373892, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Shelley Meyer: Could you give me an idea of their costs?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5179537985366816, "w": 0.587709610986492, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "House Owner: Sure. I actually have one of their brochures here. It says the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5482124284745816, "w": 0.8259487428543952, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "monthly price per room. starts at $105 and goes up to $239. That depends on", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.568681489463887, "w": 0.8262426818969536, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "which rooms you need furniture for, of course.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5890022299378397, "w": 0.4770464313985542, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Shelley Meyer: Sure. It's just to get a general idea of how much it's going to cost.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6192608598757396, "w": 0.8262107966363204, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "And you said you had some positive feedback about this company.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6395816003496924, "w": 0.6804832626475039, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "House Owner: Yes. People have mentioned that the furniture from Peak Rentals", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6698773104164306, "w": 0.8261526649875129, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "is more modern than any of the other companies. And also, once you place an", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6903462959629509, "w": 0.8257721948839433, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "order, the furniture will be delivered to you in just one or two days.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7106671118796887, "w": 0.6814911342058823, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Shelley Meyer: That would be really helpful.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7409257040961962, "w": 0.4629363833686891, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "House Owner: Oh, and the brochure says that there's a special offer at the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7711842963127037, "w": 0.8261827047989778, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "moment. If you rent living room furniture, I believe that's a set of chairs and a TV", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7916533573020091, "w": 0.8258378108543784, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "table. You'll also get a lamp at no extra cost.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8119740977759617, "w": 0.46011438401521143, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Shelley Meyer: Okay, but you know that price range you gave is more than I was", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8422326899924693, "w": 0.8262496535938123, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "hoping to pay.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8625781756999091, "w": 0.15323738433006556, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "House Owner: Then you could try Aaron and Oliver.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8928368433592017, "w": 0.5244159332800409, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Shelley Meyer: Sorry. What? And Oliver?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9230954355757092, "w": 0.4274596736036076, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}], "source": "pdf text layer"}